'''Cold/Fire/Lightning Resistance Loss''' are debuffs from the item mod {{c|mod|Nearby Enemies have -#% to # Resistance}}. Due to the error by [[pypoe]], the mod {{c|mod|-#% to # Resistance}} was in fact not shown on the item and only affects enemies.

The [[Physical Damage Taken Increase]] debuff also uses the same icon.
==Modifiers==
{{Query spawnable modifiers
|where=mod_stats.id LIKE "%local_display_nearby_enemy%damage_resistance%" AND domain NOT LIKE "16" AND mods.generation_type NOT IN ("24", "25")
|stat_text=1
|spawn_weights=1
|level=1
|generation_type =1
| tags=1
}}
===Elevated modifiers===
Elevated modifiers can only be crafted by using {{il|Maven's Orb}}

* {{ml|EnemyColdResistanceAuraInfluenceMaven}} {{c|mod|Nearby Enemies have -12% to Cold Resistance}}
* {{ml|EnemyFireResistanceAuraInfluenceMaven}} {{c|mod|Nearby Enemies have -12% to Fire Resistance}}
* {{ml|EnemyLightningResistanceAuraInfluenceMaven}} {{c|mod|Nearby Enemies have -12% to Lightning Resistance}}
* {{ml|EnemyChaosResistanceAuraInfluenceMaven}} {{c|mod|Nearby Enemies have -12% to Chaos Resistance}}
